        <item>
            <title>2.0.9</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 11:34:19 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>20009</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.0.9</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>MotionUI 2.0.9</h2>
<ul>
  <li>On Windows, MotionUI finds Claude Code again. The current Claude app keeps it in a new folder, so connecting Claude Code failed until now. It works from the AI tab of the app and from the panel.</li>
  <li>Connect now in the AI tab of the After Effects panel now connects through the MotionUI app, the same way as Connect in the app. If the app is not running, the panel starts it in the background.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
